@startuml CU-07
actor "Admin / Manager" as Adm
boundary "«UI» Angular (admin productos)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /products" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» ProductService / garment, variant, category, image" as Model

Adm -> UI : Registrar una prenda del catálogo
UI -> Ctrl : POST /products (Bearer ADMIN/MANAGER)
Ctrl -> Model : create(db, payload) → prenda + categoría + imágenes
Model --> Ctrl : GarmentRead (precios, min_price, categoría)
Ctrl --> UI : 201 GarmentRead

Adm -> UI : Consultar una prenda
UI -> Ctrl : GET /products/{garment_id}
Ctrl -> Model : get(db, garment_id)
Model --> Ctrl : GarmentRead completo
Ctrl --> UI : 200 GarmentRead

Adm -> UI : Consultar variantes (talla/color)
UI -> Ctrl : GET /products/{garment_id}/variants
Ctrl -> Model : get(db, garment_id) → variations
Model --> Ctrl : variantes con SKU y precio
Ctrl --> UI : VariantRead[]

@enduml